# StellarAid environment variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and replace placeholders with local values.
Values prefixed with `NEXT_PUBLIC_` are embedded in the browser bundle; never put
secrets, seeds, signing keys, service keys, database URLs, or Redis URLs in them.
See docs/configuration.md for the full visibility and default-value reference.

# Public values: safe to expose to the browser
NEXT_PUBLIC_STELLAR_NETWORK=testnet
NEXT_PUBLIC_SOROBAN_RPC_URL=https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Server-only values: never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_
# API_URL=https://api.internal.example.com
# SIGNING_SECRET=replace-with-secret
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@localhost:5432/stellaraid
# REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# Build-only values
# ANALYZE=false
